        {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": { "row": "1", "name": "Aarifa Qazi", "role": "3 months ago", "rating": 5, "testimonial": "I had a wonderful experience at Pearlings. The jewelry selection is beautiful, but what truly made my visit special was the exceptional service from Dilshad. She was incredibly helpful, patient, and knowledgeable. Dilshad took the time to help me select several lovely sets for an upcoming family wedding and made the whole experience enjoyable and stress-free.\n\nHer attention to detail and genuine care for the customer really stood out. I’m very grateful for her help and would highly recommend Pearlings, and especially Dilshad, to anyone looking for beautiful jewelry and excellent service." }
