        },
        {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": { "row": "2", "name": "Lauren McDonald", "role": "1 year ago", "rating": 5, "testimonial": "Amazing store that outfits me for my Nikkah and Walima.\n\nI came in with a general idea of what I wanted for my wedding jewelry to look like, and they exceeded my expectations. I wanted to have a simple look, and they accepted the challenge. They far exceeded everything and will continue to come back for my jewelry needs." }
        },
        {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": { "row": "1", "name": "Sherebanu Ramakdawala", "role": "1 year ago", "rating": 5, "testimonial": "This is the perfect place for wedding jewelry shopping! The service is exceptional, with the owner and staff being incredibly helpful. They assisted me in finding jewelry to complement all my outfits, and the best part is their ability to customize sets to match my attire perfectly." }
